    "text": "The angle between the lines whose direction cosine satisfy the equations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is",
